# Aimed passing (NHL94_SEATS=home:C,home:RD), Head to Head. PLAYER 1 = seat 0 =
# home C (SC 2), PLAYER 2 = seat 1 = home RD (SC 3, a human teammate). Home C
# wins the faceoff and carries (puckc = 2: a deterministic gate, no RAM
# injection). Passes use the game's own flow: hold a d-pad direction, press B,
# release B. Every pass prints an "aim pass" line (nhl94_seats.c aim_pass_hook).
PLAYER 2
WAIT 1
PLAYER 1
# Title -> setup -> Players = Two - Head to Head -> on ice (~t1600).
WAIT 600
PRESS START 5
WAIT 120
PRESS START 5
WAIT 120
PRESS DOWN 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS RIGHT 5
WAIT 20
PRESS START 5
WAIT 240
PRESS START 5
WAIT 240
PRESS START 5
WAIT_RAM16 FFB7AA 0002
WAIT 30
# pass 1: the C aims DOWN-RIGHT at the RD (human) with the stick; RD stands
HOLD DOWN
HOLD RIGHT
PRESS B 12
WAIT 20
RELEASE DOWN
RELEASE RIGHT
WAIT_RAM16 FFB7AA 0003
WAIT 30
# pass 2: the RD (human) passes UP-LEFT while the C CALLS (holds B) for the puck
PLAYER 1
HOLD B
PLAYER 2
HOLD UP
HOLD LEFT
PRESS B 12
WAIT 20
RELEASE UP
RELEASE LEFT
PLAYER 1
RELEASE B
WAIT_RAM16 FFB7AA 0002
WAIT 30
# pass 3: the C passes straight UP (nobody human there): AI mates / the game's pick
PLAYER 1
HOLD UP
PRESS B 12
WAIT 20
RELEASE UP
WAIT 300
